<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ FOOD PRICE INDEX RISES 0.8 PCT IN JULY.</title>
<headline>NZ FOOD PRICE INDEX RISES 0.8 PCT IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Wednesday released the following data for the Food Price Index for July:</p>
<p>    July 1997		  June 1997	     July 1996</p>
<p>    +0.8 pct		   +0.1 pct		+0.1 pct</p>
<p>    yr-end July 1997     yr-end June 1997   yr-end July 1996</p>
<p>    +2.7 pct		   +2.0 pct		+2.2 pct</p>
<p>Note - The index makes up 18 percent of the consumer price index (CPI). Economists polled by Reuters New Zealand had expected on average a 0.1 percent rise in the FPI in July, for a 1.93 percent rise in the year ended July.  </p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
